        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="rule" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=default;fontColor=default;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;How a task&#39;s prompt is built:&lt;/b&gt; its description (Python f-string, inputs on the left) + the raw text output of ONLY the tasks in its context=[…] list (CrewAI appends them under &#39;This is the context you&#39;re working with&#39;). Each agent&#39;s role / goal / backstory in crew_agents.py is fixed text with no session data. Anything without an arrow into a task is never seen by that agent — e.g. only Task 1 sees the VLM annotation and the examination protocol, and Task 5 never sees Task 1 or Task 3." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1400" x="40" y="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="T1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=default;fontColor=default;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Task 1 — Clinical Interpreter&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;agent: make_clinical_interpreter()&lt;br&gt;model: GROQ_MID_MODEL&lt;br&gt;context: none (first task)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;out: ≤100 words — clip soundness,&lt;br&gt;VLM agreement, expected-but-absent clips" vertex="1">
